# Testing

- Use Vitest for units/integration and Playwright for browser workflows.
- Add tests for important success, validation, empty, failure, and authorization
  behavior; do not test only the happy path.
- Add database tests proving RLS ALLOW and DENY behavior, including cross-school
  and cross-club isolation.
- Cover every constitution-listed critical workflow as it becomes implemented.
- Use axe in browser coverage and test keyboard operation for critical flows.
- Fake data and mocks are allowed only in tests and explicit development seeds.
  Never make production code depend on test fixtures.
- Keep tests deterministic and assert persisted outcomes, not just UI clicks.
